---
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
---

<section class="dsi-overview">
  <Container class="dsi-overview-grid">
    <div class="dsi-overview-intro">
      <p class="dsi-kicker">The DX series</p>
      <h2>One laser platform.<br />Three room-ready models.</h2>
      <p>
        DX-50, DX-60 and DX-70 share a 0.65-inch single-DLP laser engine, full HD resolution and a choice of fixed or motorized lenses.
      </p>
      <Button href="/products/dx-laser-series/" class="dsi-button-primary">Explore the DX series <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></Button>
    </div>

    <dl class="dsi-overview-facts">
      <div>
        <dt>Brightness range</dt>
        <dd>5,000–6,500 <span>lm</span></dd>
        <p>Series-level laser output for large-format presentation.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Native resolution</dt>
        <dd>1920 × 1080</dd>
        <p>Full HD across the DX-50, DX-60 and DX-70.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Light engine</dt>
        <dd>0.65″ DLP</dd>
        <p>Single-DLP laser platform with fixed or motorized lens options.</p>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </Container>
</section>
